#X text 1000 760 Alert is read straight off disp \, fail only: one owner per surface \, not per selector. A red grid is visible across a venue \, and a warn is not worth that., f 50;
#X text 20 800 Modal carries a palette index \, not a word: grid modal 45 turns everything blue., f 58;
