#X text 20 700 No list append between the routes: the sub-mode arrives as the selector. The class is dropped \, since this surface shows which of the six is live., f 58;
#X text 900 200 An unknown mode falls out of the reject and changes nothing \, so the grid keeps the last mode it understood., f 50;
