#X text 20 880 The mode row is CC 91 to 96 \, six of the top row \, so all 64 pads stay free (item 82)., f 58;
#X text 860 880 The beat row is grid row 1 \, indices 11 to 18 \, the bottom pads. The dim loop counts 0 to 7 and adds 11 \, while c_clock's beat is 1 to 8 \, so the bright one adds 10: with 11 on both \, beat 8 lit index 19 \, a ring button., f 58;
#X text 1280 700 tabwrite takes the value left and the index right \, so each is t b f: the index into the cold inlet first., f 46;
