#N canvas 30 30 2000 1150 paint 0;
#X text 20 20 The only thing in Cut It that sends to these LEDs: one SysEx per repaint \, the header \, 108 specs of type \, index and color \, then 247 -- 332 bytes., f 58;
#X text 20 140 The span is 1 to 108 \, every button that takes a color: LED state survives the mode switch \, so an index outside the span could never be cleared. Index 0 \, Setup \, lights nothing (items 105 \, 109 and 110 \, on the Launchpad's Reference page)., f 90;
